sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant NextAPI as Next.js API<br/>/api/catalog/*
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPN as SPN Token Service
    participant UC as Unity Catalog API

    Note over Browser,UC: Browse Catalogs (First Request - Full Auth Flow)
    Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/catalog/catalogs

    Note over NextAPI,Okta: Step 1: Validate User Session
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth->>DB: Get Session + User + Org
    DB-->>Auth: Session Context { userId, orgId }
    opt Validate Okta Token
        Auth->>Okta: Verify user token
        Okta-->>Auth: Token valid
    end
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID

    Note over NextAPI,UC: Step 2: Get SPN Token
    NextAPI->>DB: Get Organization SPN Config
    DB-->>NextAPI: SPN clientId + encrypted secret
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN access token

    alt SPN Token Missing or Expired
        SPN->>SPN: Decrypt client secret
        SPN->>UC: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
        UC-->>SPN: Access Token (1hr TTL)
        SPN->>DB: Cache encrypted SPN token
    end

    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Bearer Token

    Note over NextAPI,UC: Step 3: Call Unity Catalog API
    NextAPI->>UC: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/catalogs<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    UC-->>NextAPI: Catalog List
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { catalogs: [...] }

    Note over Browser,UC: Browse Schemas (SPN Token Cached)
    Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/catalog/schemas?catalog=main
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context + Org ID
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token (from cache)
    SPN-->>NextAPI: Cached SPN Token
    NextAPI->>UC: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/schemas
    UC-->>NextAPI: Schema List
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { schemas: [...] }

    Note over Browser,UC: Browse Tables
    Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/catalog/tables?schema=default
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token (from cache)
    SPN-->>NextAPI: Cached SPN Token
    NextAPI->>UC: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/tables
    UC-->>NextAPI: Table List
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { tables: [...] }

    Note over Browser,UC: Get Table Details
    Browser->>NextAPI: GET /api/catalog/tables/main.default.users
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Token
    NextAPI->>UC: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/tables/main.default.users
    UC-->>NextAPI: Table Metadata + Columns
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { table: {...}, columns: [...] }

    Note over Browser,UC: Preview Table Data
    Browser->>NextAPI: POST /api/catalog/preview
    Note right of NextAPI: { table: "main.default.users", limit: 100 }
    NextAPI->>Auth: Validate Session
    Auth-->>NextAPI: User Context
    NextAPI->>SPN: Get SPN token
    SPN-->>NextAPI: SPN Token
    NextAPI->>UC: Execute SQL via Statement API<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
    UC-->>NextAPI: Sample Rows
    NextAPI-->>Browser: { rows: [...], schema: [...] }
